.SH "نام (NAME)"
lrunzip \- Uncompress LRZ files
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.IX Header "SYNOPSIS"
.Vb 1
\&  lrunzip [options] FILE [... FILE]
.Ve
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.IX Header "DESCRIPTION"
lrunzip is identical to \f(CW\*(C`lrzip \-d\*(C'\fR used to decompress files.
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.IX Header "OPTIONS"
See \fBlrzip\fR\|(1).
.SH "محیط (ENVIRONMENT)"
.IX Header "ENVIRONMENT"
None.
.SH "فایل‌ها (FILES)"
.IX Header "FILES"
None.
